commit: (git not used)
bug: /shell-logs UI couldn't find framework shell logs after runtime namespacing (secrets/runtime_id)
summary: UI linked to /shell-logs/{shell_id}; backend ws reader still looked in ~/.cache/te_framework/logs instead of runtime-scoped record paths, so logs appeared missing.
fix: Resolve stdout/stderr log paths from the framework_shells ShellRecord (rec.stdout_log/rec.stderr_log) and read with utf-8 errors=replace.
files: app/extensions/apps/main.py

