change: add configurable framework/ipc ports + IPC sleep mode with hardcoded listener port 9100
summary: framework port was hardcoded (8089) and supervisor hardcoded IPC URL (9099); added CLI/env plumbing for ports; added IPC sleep listener on :9100 with /actions/wake and /actions/sleep to start/stop framework without killing IPC; run_framework.sh now starts IPC with sleep listener and wakes framework unless --sleep.
